    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SOC-09 Comments\nPostiz has no comments API, so this reads the Facebook Page through Meta Graph (credential 'Meta Page token', soc_config.facebook_page_id). Instagram, TikTok and others are added once their business APIs are approved. Replies are drafts only; complaints, legal, money and anything sensitive always go to Rukky.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "2c8b8043-9c4c-4be5-a27c-264cda6bb4c9",
